    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619350/extras/52810d4ce5db0deb9acc5f23a3b57fe7.poster.avif?t=1728639064\" width=800 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619350/extras/52810d4ce5db0deb9acc5f23a3b57fe7.webm?t=1728639064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619350/extras/52810d4ce5db0deb9acc5f23a3b57fe7.mp4?t=1728639064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lewd Cell is the first game from indie developer Lewd Leech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things go wrong in a company that conducts research on a spaceship in space, where living things survive by reproducing. Will our assigned heroine, Meimei, be able to completely eliminate this research? The creatures are very horny, the heroine needs to be very careful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619350/extras/216fb6903fca875c68f359894cbf4c24.avif?t=1728639064\" width=800 height=238 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duty:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Destroy 7 cysts that spread the disease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Defeat the 4 big bosses controlling the research ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Shut down the farmer supplying power and oil to the research vessel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619350/extras/708b6fbca4cc6dcf2f76e48cba48742c.avif?t=1728639064\" width=800 height=238 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></p><p clas